#
# Counter-example for math:RestrictionImageShape (derived from the min-1 qualified
# restrictions on math:RestrictionImage's math:imageSourceValue and
# math:imageTargetValue): a math:RestrictionImage naming neither the exact-integer
# input it records nor the exact-integer output the map sends it to. Validation MUST
# emit shacl.MinCountConstraintComponent (math:IncompleteRestrictionImage).
@prefix math: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/> .
@prefix ex:   <http://example.org/math/> .

ex:bareImage a math:RestrictionImage .
